		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a79" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts156" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts157">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>And he took the middle seat, and he asked Hankin to sit on his right, I think, and Scott to sit on his left.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
