				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>And he started telling me how sorry he was that he missed my colloquium and he had gotten very good reports about it, and he wanted me to go over the main definitions and the main theorems with him, which I did.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
