			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a101" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts200" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts201">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>And after I got finished doing this, he alleged that my main result had been gotten two years earlier by one of his students in front of all these people.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
