		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a103" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts204" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts205">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah, I had read this thing that he said I had my name resulted and it didn't seem to be the same result at all or even closely related, although I mean, I read the published the published abstracts, but maybe in the dissertation there was some things that weren't in the abstract.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
