		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a161" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts320" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts321">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>So he wrote you this letter asking you to be a ghost editor after you'd done the work on But when would that be then?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
