		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a176" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts350" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts351">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>Well he actually I think he paid a lot Did you ever spend after that year in Berkeley did you spend other Yeah I spent a lot of time with Tarski in the I think eighty one and ' eighty two.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a177" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts352" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts353">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>I came out here one time I came out here for two months and worked with him three or four days a week on this and on two other projects well mainly on one other project it was mostly on this on logic seman and mathematics but he gave me the manuscript of his article What are logical notions and asked me to edit that and get it into print which I did.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a178" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts354" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts355">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yes.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a179" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts356" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts357">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>And then he felt that his French article on the deductive method was much better than Chapter six of Introduction to Logic.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a180" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts358" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts359">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>And he wanted that translated into English and published.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a181" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts360" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts361">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I translated it and then worked with him I don't know how many four or five hour sessions three or four going over the whole thing.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a182" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts362" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts363">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>On the last one we had already gone over the whole translation sentence by sentence and finally it was late at night was say two in the morning Yeah I'm going to ask you whether you have late night sessions two in the morning and he wanted me to read the whole thing to him very slowly paragraph by paragraph to make sure the whole thing sounded right.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a183" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts364" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts365">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>The whole thing being how long?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
