			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a199" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts396" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts397">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>But there were other things that earlier on but earlier on he had taken benzedrine and it wasn't just at night.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
